          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.085,
            0.723,
            0.133
          ],
          "content": "**But, let us take another look at butane. If we make the carbon ‘skeleton’ with four carbon atoms, we see that two different possible ‘skeletons’ are –**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
